  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "In a blender, combine kicap manis, koosh jerky, kosher salt, black pepper, sugar, and 2 cups of water. Blend until smooth.",
    "Add the blended mixture to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the rice noodles to the pan and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes, until the noodles are coated in the sauce and slightly caramelized.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and chili flakes, to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional scallions if desired."
